# Waydoodle

This is a Wayland application implemented in Rust that allows the user to draw
on the screen (e.g. for presentations). It shows a tray icon that can be used to
toggle the drawing mode on and off.

## Conventions

- Avoid writing top-level comments separating sections like:

  ```
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Event‑loop thread
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ```
